    {
      "id": 25262,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "While fuzzing patterns of certain snapchat related projects, I was able to find an instance of Grafana which was accessible by a guest user. That instance contained hundreds of production dashboards, valuable data about company. Furthermore one of the custom modules was vulnerable to SQL Injection.",
